    "english": {
      "headingRaw": "Seven-character-ancient-verseLiuZongyuanANOLDFISHERMAN",
      "translationRaw": "Anoldfishermanspentthenighthere，underthewesterncliff；HedippedupwaterfromthepureHsiangandmadeabamboofire；Andthen，atsunrise，hewenthiswaythroughtheclovenmist，Withonlythecreakofhispaddleleft，inthegreennessofmountainandriver。。。。Iturnandseethewavesmovingasfromheaven，Andcloudsabovethecliffscomingidly，onebyone。",
